The ZXing-derived scanner foundation in src/fws/foundation.fws is a source-level
adaptation of the core luminance, binarization, bit-container, perspective
sampling, and Reed–Solomon/Galois-field contracts. It is modified for Forge Web
Script's bounded POD records, caller-owned linear memory, and status-code ABI;
it is not a verbatim Java port. Format readers and browser adapters are outside
this attribution boundary until their respective migration steps are completed.

